{
  "abstract_summary": "LLM agents on long-horizon tasks fail in recurring, procedural ways. They mis-paginate an API, resolve the wrong entity, or answer when no answer was asked. We built a pipeline that lets an agent learn from its own history. It first mines short \\emph{lessons} from the agent's own trajectories, one to three per episo...",
